              "id": "PRRC_kwDOIVbAxs73j5Sr",
              "body": "**<sub><sub>![P2 Badge](https://img.shields.io/badge/P2-yellow?style=flat)</sub></sub>  Use the actual \u201c\u00d3rdenes\u201d navigation label**\n\nFor Spanish readers following this path, the current UI calls this object section **\u00d3rdenes**, not **Pedidos**; the preserved native Spanish evidence confirms both the page title and heading as \u201c\u00d3rdenes\u201d (`docs/editorial-work/captures/orders-with-api/details-es-ui.json`, lines 3 and 26). Using the wrong menu label makes the verification step harder to follow and conflicts with the other localized guides, so change this path to **Configuraci\u00f3n > Objetos > \u00d3rdenes**.\n\nUseful? React with \ud83d\udc4d\u00a0/ \ud83d\udc4e.",
